OL,3,GNEWSAViews sought on proposals to close
OL,4,Aor merge schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FA consultation has opened on the future
OL,7,Fof two primary schools which could
OL,8,Fclose or merge next year.
OL,10,FViews are being sought on options for
OL,11,FGoodnestone school in Canterbury and
OL,12,FNonington school in Dover amid concerns
OL,13,Fover the viability of very small
OL,14,Fschools and the challenges they face,
OL,15,FKent County Council (KCC) said.
OL,17,FThe council said with low pupil
OL,18,Fnumbers, limited staffing and mixed-age
OL,19,Fclasses, pupils did not have access to
OL,20,Fthe same opportunities and peer
OL,21,Finteraction as at larger schools.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
