OL,3,GNEWSAViews sought on proposals to close
OL,4,Aor merge schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FKCC has proposed the schools close from
OL,7,F31 August. School governors and the
OL,8,FCanterbury Diocese Board of Education
OL,9,Fproposed the Church of England schools
OL,10,Fmerge on the Goodnestone site from 1
OL,11,FSeptember.
